      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "When my husband and I decided to go solar, I did the online application and received three phone calls. We chose Callum McIverof SunEnergy. We found Callum to be relaxed i.e. not at all pushy, patient, very informative and willing to answer any of our questions.My husband told Callum that we have a timber and mud brick housewith raked ceilings and Callum assured us that the best team will do the job. Amazing team. The team had to work between light showers and still finished the job (32 panels ) ahead of time. High accolades to the electrician, Johanna de Bruin! She is Wonder Woman. Not only did Johanna have to drill through the mud brick, but a Jarrah beam as well. Both executed with perfection.My husband and I are extremely happy with SunEnergy and their teams and have no hesitation in recommending SunEnergy as your solar provider. A big thank you to Callum McIver.",
